usage: wiki [-h] {ingest,search,ask,chat,check,help} ...

Personal wiki CLI: local Gemma + RAG over your own notes.

positional arguments:
  {ingest,search,ask,chat,check,help}
    ingest              build/update wiki pages from raw sources
    search              show matching original passages (no model)
    ask                 grounded factual answer with citations
    chat                talk with your personal assistant
    check               lint vault links and note names
    help                show this help

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit

modes:
  ingest   read vault/raw, have local Gemma write linked notes in vault/wiki, rebuild index.md + search index
  search   show original matching passages and paths (retrieval only, no model — works with Ollama stopped)
  ask      standalone factual answer from retrieved evidence, with [S#] citations or INSUFFICIENT EVIDENCE
  chat     personal assistant 'Sage' with conversation memory; searches notes only when useful
  check    verify every [[link]] in the vault resolves and note names are readable

configuration:
  model     gemma4:e4b   (override with WIKI_MODEL=...)
  runtime   Ollama at http://127.0.0.1:11434   (start: brew services start ollama)
  vault     vault/   · machine data in data/

examples:
  ./wiki ingest vault/raw
  ./wiki search "workshop location"
  ./wiki ask "Where is the workshop?"
  ./wiki chat

